Description: Tools for single-cell alternative polyadenylation (APA) analysis.
    Provides an end-to-end workflow: loading and annotating single-cell data,
    quality control with per-cell-type thresholds, normalization and
    integration, building polyA site assays from peak counts, and differential
    polyA usage analysis with RED, DPAU and gDPAU scores, plus coverage and
    QC visualization.
